  "title": "Valneva to Participate at U.S. and European Investor Conferences in June",
  "summary": "Lyon (France), May 28, 2026 – Valneva SE (Nasdaq: VALN; Euronext Paris: VLA), a specialty vaccine company, today announced that its senior management will present and hold investor meetings at several upcoming investor conferences in the United States and Europe in June 2026. To access the full release, please click on the PDF below.",
